{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11110190","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11110190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1111018001:":{"text":"くまなく探せ！","source_cn":"都给我仔细找","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C8C2C9C05F0E607","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1111018002:":{"text":"使えそうな物は\n全部本営に持ち帰るんだ！","source_cn":"还能用的东西全带回主营去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60253762F164EE65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1111018003:":{"text":"見ろよお前ら、お客さんだ。","source_cn":"瞧瞧，弟兄们，有人来了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F322A8214FF18AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1111018004:":{"text":"ウォルク、懐かしいなぁ……","source_cn":"瓦尔克，我们的老熟人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8407E7C217168C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111019001:1":{"text":"見ろよみんな、鹹水町の英雄、サンドクローのボスを暗殺したバウンティハンター、ウォルク様だぜ！","source_cn":"看看谁来了？咸水镇的大英雄，曾经刺杀流沙之爪首领的赏金...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE41679E8FE5E293","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111019002:1":{"text":"ああ、すまんすまん、暗殺は失敗したんだっけか？フランク様から命からがら逃げ出したんだよなぁ？","source_cn":"哦——对不起，我忘了，那次刺杀行动失败了，对吧？你从弗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x407EEEBC986AB300","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111019003:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111019004:1":{"text":"お前の相棒のことも覚えてるぜ。ワット？それともティアットだったか？","source_cn":"你的搭档。我还记得他。怀特？还是提亚特？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE125151B8492592","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111019005:1":{"text":"妙な組み合わせだよなぁ、ウォルクとティアット、人間とババリア。報酬さえ見合えば、やれない任務はない……","source_cn":"奇怪的赏金猎人搭档，瓦尔克与提亚特，人类和蛮血，只要价...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7487CCE177FB6692","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1111019005":{"text":"妙な組み合わせだよなぁ、ウォルクとティアット、人間とババリア。報酬さえ見合えば、やれない任務はない……","source_cn":"奇怪的赏金猎人搭档，瓦尔克与提亚特，人类和蛮血，只要价格合适，没有完不成的任务……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7487CCE177FB6692","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111019006:1":{"text":"ワイアットだ。","source_cn":"他叫怀亚特。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECBA0CAD6B278899","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111019007:1":{"text":"ああ、そうそう、ワイアットだ！フランク様に砂漠で打ち抜かれたんだっけ。結局葬式は挙げたのか？","source_cn":"哦，对，怀亚特！那是他的新名字！我记得弗兰克头儿在沙漠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA7AA3314F5C9958","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111019008:1":{"text":"ババリアは弱者のために涙は流さないが、人間はどうだ？棺桶に向かっておんおん泣くのか？","source_cn":"蛮血不会为弱者哭泣，那你们人类呢？会对着棺材哀悼吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48B4824B569EF0BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1111019009:1":{"text":"黙れ。","source_cn":"闭嘴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB919F76B0D8C6BE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1111019010:1":{"text":"はっ！またババリアかよ！","source_cn":"哈！又一个蛮血小子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB47536EA9A96EDC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111019011:1":{"text":"死んだ相棒の復讐を手伝ってくれって、ウォルクに頼まれたのか？","source_cn":"搭档死了，瓦尔克想找我们复仇，就找上你了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65C94EC48998C18A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1111019012:1":{"text":"違う、オレは誰の相棒でもない！","source_cn":"我、不是、任何人的搭档！别拿我和他混为一谈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34A2AB13F4CBE244","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1111019013:1":{"text":"これは善意の忠告だぜ兄ちゃん、このままだと信頼するお仲間のために命を落とすことになるぞ。","source_cn":"蛮血小子，别不知好歹，你信任的同伴正在把你送上绝路呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96B236D928038967","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1111019014:1":{"text":"こいつは俺たちの強さを知ってるから、お前たちを巻き込んだんだ。こんな奴と一緒に死にたかないだろ？","source_cn":"他知道我们的厉害，所以才带着你来挑战我们，你就不怕陪他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA320DE712B3589A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111019015:0":{"text":"こいつの過去は、オレには関係ない。","source_cn":"瓦尔克的过去，我管不着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x245EC046662687F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1111019016:1":{"text":"だが、あんたは、気に食わない！","source_cn":"我只知道，你，让我很不爽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89F3CE9032292FE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docume